      <h2>The goal</h2>
      <p>Knock out <b>3</b> of your opponent's characters. Each side has one <b>Active</b> fighting and a <b>Backstage</b> that steps up when the Active falls.</p>
      <h2>A turn, in three phases</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><b>\u2460 Draw.</b> You draw <b>one card</b> per turn. Your hand is small on purpose \u2014 every card you spend is a real cost.</li>
        <li><b>\u2461 Strategize.</b> Where the game is played. You may <b>charge 2 cards</b>, <b>shed 2 cards</b>, play up to <b>2 Bookmarks</b>, and deploy one <b>Critical Lens</b>.</li>
        <li><b>\u2462 Engage.</b> Once a move has its cost charged, tap it to strike. The defender chooses whether to block.</li>
