      <div class="gd-box"><b class="lbl">Reading a card</b>A move shows <span class="pc-chip red">50/2</span> \u2014 <b>50 damage</b> for <b>2 charged cards</b>. <span class="pc-chip blue">30/2</span> on the lower row is a block. <b>X</b> means it negates instead of blocking a number, and a <b>+</b> like <span class="pc-chip red">20+/2</span> means it grows.</div>
