      <div class="gd-kw"><b class="n">Iterum Probare \u2014 try again</b>Miss a question and you are offered a second attempt. <b>Shed a card from your hand</b> and the same question returns with your wrong answer struck out. The card is spent either way. One retry per question.</div>
      <div class="gd-kw"><b class="n">Marginalia \u2014 reach back into the pile</b>Tap your own discard during Strategize. Pick an <b>ABC</b> you shed earlier, spend an attach, and answer <b>two</b> questions to charge it straight onto your Active. Miss either and the attach is gone and the card stays buried. <b>Iterum Probare does not apply here.</b></div>
      <h2>The discard pile is a resource</h2>
