/* ---- STARTER FLOOR ---------------------------------------------------------
   A guaranteed minimum beneath every collection. Nothing is written to the save,
   so it can never be lost to cleared storage, a new device, or a changed file path,
   and existing players get it with no migration. Earned copies always win.
   Base bookmarks 0-11 (the pre-rarity core set): 3 copies each, except the four
   swingiest (First Aid Kit, Cliffnotes, Truce, Crown of Denmark) held at 2 so an
   opening deck can't stack them. 32 available for 20 slots. */
const STARTER_BM = {
  /* Two copies each of sixteen, rather than 2-3 copies of twelve. Same 32
     cards, four more distinct, and the four additions are the first STATUS
     and BOOST cards a new player owns — the old starter was ITEM and
     SUPPORT only, so nothing in it inflicted or granted a status. Sixteen
     distinct also makes a singleton Pagemaster deck (14) buildable. */
  0:2,  1:2,  2:2,  3:2,  4:2,  5:2,  6:2,  7:2,
  8:2,  9:2, 10:2, 11:2,
  12:2,          // Torn Chapter      — inflict Tear
  18:2,          // Sticky Situation  — inflict Glue
  23:2,          // Proofread         — remove a negative status
  25:2           // Highlight Passage — grant Highlight
