      ended by knockouts ${pct(cnt(function(g){ return g.end_reason==='knockouts'; }))}, turn cap ${pct(cnt(function(g){ return g.end_reason==='turn_cap'; }))}${cnt(function(g){ return g.end_reason==='stalled'; })?`, stalled ${cnt(function(g){ return g.end_reason==='stalled'; })}`:''}</p>
